  unitName: "Mai Shiranui (6\u2605)"
  unitId: 810176
  unitNumber: 8211
  description: "A cheerful yet temperamental kunoichi. Mai\u2019s investigation into
    the mysterious invitation led her to places and parts unknown. From deserts to
    swamps, mountains to abandoned cities, each discovery only held more questions
    that she could not answer. At last, it was in an abandoned strip-mining facility
    that she finally found the gate mentioned in the invitation. Approaching the
    gate, she thought she heard the phantom cry of her beloved, and thus leapt in
    without a second thought. It was only when the tendrils of madness started to
    choke her unwary mind that she realized her mistake."
  summonDesc: Here comes, Mai Shiranui!
  fusionDesc: Nice try,<br>but you're not my type!
